%% Browser bridge (bridge.rs): one POST /v1/download from the extension.
%% Checks run in this order; any failure ends the request with the status shown.
sequenceDiagram
    participant X as Chrome extension
    participant G as guard (middleware)
    participant H as handler (download/batch)
    participant B as Bridge (settings, pending)
    participant A as TauriBridgeHost (main.rs)
    participant UI as React UI

    X->>G: POST 127.0.0.1:PORT/v1/download<br/>X-IDM-Token, Origin: chrome-extension://id
    G->>G: Host loopback? (else 403 — DNS rebinding)
    G->>G: Origin absent or allowed extension? (else 403)
    alt OPTIONS preflight
        G-->>X: 204 + ACAO: that origin (never *)
    end
    G->>G: token matches (constant time)? (else 401 bad_token; ping exempt)
    G->>H: pass
    H->>H: Content-Type JSON (415), body ≤ 64 KB (413)
    H->>H: validate: http(s) URLs only, header names/values,<br/>fileName → safe_file_name, kind auto/file/stream (400)
    H->>B: submit(job, fromExtension)
    B->>B: same URL within 5 s? → first result, duplicate:true
    Note over B: takeover from the extension origin → start now<br/>(≤20 per 10 s, else pending; confirmTakeover=on → pending)<br/>user-action / page-scan → askBeforeStart (≤50 pending, else 429 app_busy)<br/>command-line → always pending
    alt needs confirmation
        B->>B: keep job in memory (cookies never persisted)
        B->>A: pending_added
        A-->>UI: emit bridge-request (names only, no header values)
        B-->>X: 200 {ok, id, fileName, queued:false}
        UI->>A: invoke accept_bridge_request(id)
        A->>B: accept → take job
        A-->>UI: emit bridge-request-removed
    else starts now
        B-->>X: 200 {ok, id, fileName, queued:true}
    end
    B->>A: start(id, job)
    A->>A: enqueue_download (same path as start_download)<br/>History stores header NAMES only<br/>preflight → 503 ytdlp_missing / ffmpeg_missing
    alt manifest (.m3u8/.mpd)
        A->>A: stream_dl: yt-dlp --add-header … -f quality, one job,<br/>temp dir removed, output must be inside the folder
    else page stream / file
        A->>A: yt-dlp -J + engine + mux / segmented engine
    end
    A-->>UI: queue-status → normal download card
